        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DASHS5 Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n5\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Surface Mount - Door flange is surface mounted to edge of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 1-1/8\" to 1-1/2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana 5\" Double Acting Spring Hinges permit doors to open in either direction and automatically return to the closed position. Packaged complete with a Pair (2) Double Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DASHS5 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Surface Mount</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/8\" - 1-1/2\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DASHS5-specifications.pdf?v=1774586581\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DASHS5 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DASHS-installation.pdf?v=1774586581\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DASHS Series Installation (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3029 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Deltana DASHS5 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Deltana Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>DASHS5</td>\r\n<td>60 lbs</td>\r\n<td>28\"</td>\r\n<td>80 lbs</td>\r\n<td>30\"</td>\r\n<td>1-1/8\" - 1-1/2\"</td>\r\n<td>6'-8\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Do Not use on Doors with Hinge Edge Beveled.</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 3029 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>",
